{"version": 2, "width": 98, "height": 44, "timestamp": 1788703771, "idle_time_limit": 2.5, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "flanker: library demo, pristine vs modernized"}
[0.003843, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[0.004346, "o", "\u001b[1m# flanker — what the library does, and the modernized code doing it identically\u001b[0m\r\n#   parse messy addresses · walk a MIME message · score a bounce\r\n#   fork: github.com/ash-171/flanker @ modernize\r\n\r\n"]
[2.506937, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m bash modernization/demo-both.sh\r\n"]
[3.519927, "o", "### flanker, running on the MODERNIZED code\r\n"]
[3.717291, "o", "flanker loaded from: /home/aswati/Aswathi/code-modernization-case-study/repos/flanker-modern/flanker\r\npython: 3.11.15\r\n"]
[4.917513, "o", "\r\n1. Address list -- split and normalize\r\n--------------------------------------\r\n  parse_list of:\r\n    \"Alice K.\" <ALICE@Example.COM>, torvalds@kernel.org, bob@marley.example\r\n  ->\r\n"]
[4.918486, "o", "    - ALICE@example.com             host=example.com\r\n    - torvalds@kernel.org           host=kernel.org\r\n    - bob@marley.example            host=marley.example\r\n"]
[6.118617, "o", "\r\n2. One address with a comma in the display name\r\n-----------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[6.118769, "o", "  input       : \"Bob, Jr.\" <BOB@Example.COM>\r\n  display_name: Bob, Jr.\r\n  address     : BOB@example.com          (host lower-cased, local part kept)\r\n"]
[6.119039, "o", "  full_spec() : \"Bob, Jr.\" <BOB@example.com>\r\n"]
[7.319393, "o", "\r\n3. Internationalized address -> punycode (IDNA)\r\n-----------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[7.320886, "o", "  to_unicode() : Алиса <alice@почта.рф>\r\n  address      : alice@почта.рф\r\n"]
[7.321067, "o", "  ace_address  : alice@xn--80a1acny.xn--p1ai\r\n"]
[8.521363, "o", "\r\n4. Reject junk\r\n--------------\r\n"]
[8.521628, "o", "  parse('not an email') -> None\r\n  parse('@nope') -> None\r\n"]
[8.521956, "o", "  parse('a b c') -> None\r\n"]
[9.722223, "o", "\r\n5. MIME message -- structure, attachment, round-trip\r\n----------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[9.724414, "o", "  subject     : test message via curl - extra content-type (_001_)\r\n  content_type: multipart/mixed\r\n  part tree   :\r\n"]
[9.724461, "o", "    multipart/mixed\r\n"]
[9.724792, "o", "    multipart/alternative\r\n"]
[9.724961, "o", "    text/plain\r\n"]
[9.725406, "o", "    application/pdf  <- attachment: test.pdf\r\n"]
[9.725859, "o", "  to_string() reproduces the original byte-for-byte: True\r\n"]
[10.926039, "o", "\r\n6. Bounce detection\r\n-------------------\r\n"]
[10.929519, "o", "  is_bounce()     : True\r\n  score           : 1.875\r\n  status          : 5.1.1\r\n  diagnostic_code : smtp; 550-5.1.1 The email account that you tried to reach does    not ...\r\n\r\n"]
[10.971947, "o", "\r\n### same script -- pristine vs modernized, Python 3.11 and 3.14 -- must match\r\n"]
[11.566491, "o", "  pristine 3.11  ==  modernized 3.11\r\n"]
[11.567375, "o", "  pristine 3.11  ==  modernized 3.14\r\n"]
[11.568283, "o", "\r\n"]
